        "y0": 0.5292517356198243,
        "x1": 0.8235128066119026,
        "y1": 0.5418307757136798
      },
      "text": "has",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.5443476872010664,
        "x1": 0.8229001612445108,
        "y1": 0.5569267272949219
      },
      "text": "been assumed in [97,98]. As an indication, the experimental data from other literature are",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.5594423672165534,
        "x1": 0.8228838552836499,
        "y1": 0.5720214073104088
      },
      "text": "also provided in Figure18(black crosses), although these studies are lacking either well-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.5745370472320402,
        "x1": 0.8228838054183262,
        "y1": 0.5871160873258956
      },
      "text": "defined strain measurements or complete stress-strain curves under uniaxial compression.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.5896317272475271,
        "x1": 0.8228513430925756,
        "y1": 0.6022107673413826
      },
      "text": "A remarkable inconsistency between the experimental data reported in different literature",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.6047264072630141,
        "x1": 0.822916417340048,
        "y1": 0.6173054473568695
      },
      "text": "can be noticed. This places a clear need of more attention to the experimental aspects, e.g.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.6198223588442562,
        "x1": 0.7818125307170394,
        "y1": 0.6324013989381116
      },
      "text": "test method, sample shape, sample size and determination of compressive properties.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.20088893915313522,
        "y0": 0.634917038859743,
        "x1": 0.8229165669360192,
        "y1": 0.6474960789535985
      },
      "text": "In the following, the numerical model predictions are compared with the experimental",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.6500117188752299,
        "x1": 0.8228512932272518,
        "y1": 0.6625907589690854
      },
      "text": "data from [97,98] only, given their reliability and relevance. The model set “StSt”, with all",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.6651064181568647,
        "x1": 0.8228512932272518,
        "y1": 0.6776854582507201
      },
      "text": "the cell size, cell wall thickness and cell shape anisotropy stochastics incorporated, seems to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.6802011174384994,
        "x1": 0.6699124005884906,
        "y1": 0.6927801575323548
      },
      "text": "deliver the closest predictions with respect to the experimental data.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6785564048617494,
        "y0": 0.6802011174384994,
        "x1": 0.8228188309015012,
        "y1": 0.6927801575323548
      },
      "text": "In particular for the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.6952958167201341,
        "x1": 0.8229000615138634,
        "y1": 0.7078748568139894
      },
      "text": "compressive moduli and Poisson’s ratios, an excellent agreement between the experimental",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.7103917683013762,
        "x1": 0.5092085296032476,
        "y1": 0.7229708083952315
      },
      "text": "data and “StSt” predictions can be observed.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5216291839001226,
        "y0": 0.7103917683013762,
        "x1": 0.8229328230315563,
        "y1": 0.7229708083952315
      },
      "text": "Relatively large deviations appear on the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17647063810061786,
        "y0": 0.7254864675830108,
        "x1": 0.4442562028473499,
        "y1": 0.7380655076768663
      },
      "text": "strengths, which are overestimated by",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.44947391086154515,
        "y0": 0.7254864675830108,
        "x1": 0.4621224995532067,
        "y1": 0.7380655076768663
      },
      "text": "∼",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
