        "x1": 0.8228682848363141,
        "y1": 0.8173129919803503
      },
      "text": "of different model sets are computed, and reported in Figures20(a) and (b), respectively.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
